# Compare Northern White and Black Rhinos

@body

![Rhino example](assets/lect11c_rhino/north_black.drawn.svg)

Twelve positions differ. Enter 12 in both matching cells.

{table-style=comparison border="0.5pt solid #C5CBD2" table-group=rhino-three padding="3pt 2pt" font-size=22pt}
|  | N.Wh. | S.Wh. | Blk.R |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| N.Wh. | 0 | 4 | 12 |
| S.Wh. | 4 | 0 | ? |
| Blk.R | 12 | ? | 0 |


